### Uses variables from .vscode/settings.json (local/production)

### Calculate TVA from SIREN
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tva-calculator?siren=443061841
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Calculate TVA - with spaces in SIREN
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tva-calculator?siren=443-061-841
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Calculate TVA - invalid SIREN (too short)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tva-calculator?siren=12345
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Calculate TVA - XML response via query param
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tva-calculator?siren=443061841&format=xml
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Calculate TVA - XML response via Accept header
GET {{host}}/api/v1/tva-calculator?siren=443061841
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/xml
